; ═══ FINAL STANDINGS ═══
; ⚠️ THIS REPLACES TWO THREE-PIP WIN ROWS — § CHECKLIST 1.3. The pips counted SETS
; won by two teams. Four players scoring cumulatively is a table, not a pip row, and
; squeezing four totals into three squares would be a chart that lies about the margin.
;
; `match_result.gd` had already hidden them and appended a newline-joined Label in code,
; which is exactly what 1.3 called "gutted, not designed". Four authored rows —
; place, name, points — bound by the script.
